  "description": "Test build of Volibear as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Volibear so The Relentless Storm's five-stack lightning strikes the target and the 4 nearest enemies (the main pack: a bolt that splashes round the target), Frenzied Maul keeps its mark on the champion bitten and the second bite heals by his missing health (the main pack: any second maul, a flat heal), Stormbringer's landing disables nearby enemy towers, and for the 12 s storm form after it he is drawn in electric blue with a glowing outline (the main pack: his own colours under the storm cloud). Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
